d": "1423332506179517", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303198_1423332509512850_2032938320805380769_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FTpAyMenmdkQ7kNvwH2LHCm&_nc_oc=AdoXK_K2gJarkcr3H2gaYtf4n57edKKIjvtXfN0DYqA-wPERr-WLqqfeDFrQ4KaQbC0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_qWq11h76nallM8oBeZjx8dzhZq3sOqhjnyEtgi3hcPQ&oe=6A22C7F3"}, "display_name": "Virtual Orator", "keywords": ["PublicSpeaking", "PresentationSkills", "Confidence", "Communication", "VRtraining"], "long_description": "Virtual Orator is an immersive VR public speaking trainer designed to help you build confidence, sharpen communication skills, and rehearse presentations in realistic audience environments.\n\nStep in front of a virtual audience and practice delivering talks, pitches, lectures, or meetings in a safe and controlled setting. Adjust the venue, audience size, and audience behavior to match your needs \u2014 from small supportive groups to large formal settings.\n\nKey features:\n* multiple realistic venues and presentation spaces\n* adjustable audience size and responsiveness\n* support for your own presentation slides\n* speaker notes for structured rehearsal\n* remote and hybrid presentation practice modes\n* dynamic audience behavior powered by AI\n* session feedback to support skill development\n\nWhether you're preparing for a big presentation, overcoming stage nerves, or refining professional communication skills, Virtual Orator gives you the freedom to practice anytime.", "short_description": "Practice public speaking in realistic VR audiences. The right audience at a button click to help build confidence, refine presentations, and improve communication skills with immersive, customizable speaking scenarios."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualorator.com/app-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://virtualorator.com/EULA/", "publisher_name": "Virtual Human Tec